      "id": "34648126",
      "index": 218,
      "english": "    Even if Xion is a replica--a puppet--she's still\nXion. I understand that in my head, but how do I\ninteract with her now? Riku Replica was just a tool,\nbut I can't just use Xion. No, I was wrong to have\njust used Riku Replica in the first place. How is a\nman-made puppet any less worthy than a Nobody\nthat was never meant to exist at all?\n    They're both ambiguous. Tenuous at best. And\nshe's my friend. Even if neither of us should exist,\nthat doesn't invalidate the bonds we form. Next break\nwe get, I told her we'd all go to the beach. I hope we\nget the chance. Our little summer vacation. I know if\nwe can get together and laugh about stupid stuff,\nthis nagging doubt will go away.",
